  "notes": "All numbers are per serve, copied from the 'Per Serving' columns of Hungry Jack's official category nutrition PDFs linked from https://www.hungryjacks.com.au/nutrition-info (the PDFs also list per-100g values, not used). Hungry Jack's publishes kJ only, so calories_kcal = round(kJ/4.184). Names drop the guide's store-status column (Permanent/Trial/LTO). Hungry Jack's own figures sometimes do not add up: for several items (e.g. Whopper, Whopper Junior, Chicken Royale) the stated fat, protein and carbs imply noticeably more energy than the published kJ. The per-100g and per-serve columns agree with each other, so these are the published values, not copy errors. Turkish Bread Bacon Egg is published with only 4.6 g carbs, which looks low for a bread item but is what the guide states. Bigger sizes and variants (Whopper Triple, Nugget 3/4 packs, Onion Rings Large, Small/Large shakes and sundaes, Grill Masters doubles, spicy chicken burgers) are in the same PDFs if the food log needs them. Direct download (curl) was blocked by the sandbox proxy, so values were read through WebFetch and row-level cross-checked against per-100g values for the burgers, Grill Masters and breakfast items."
